{"type":"auditAdvisory","data":{"resolution":{"id":1147955,"path":"query-string>decode-uri-component","dev":false,"optional":false,"bundled":false},"advisory":{"findings":[{"version":"0.2.2","paths":["query-string>decode-uri-component","react-admin>ra-core>query-string>decode-uri-component","react-admin>ra-i18n-polyglot>ra-core>query-string>decode-uri-component"]}],"found_by":null,"deleted":null,"references":"- https://github.com/SamVerschueren/decode-uri-component/security/advisories/GHSA-vcc3-ghjq-m6fr\n- https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-45822\n- https://github.com/SamVerschueren/decode-uri-component/commit/fa479dafeede7bedf04e5c89aa78f2a78c664005\n- https://github.com/SamVerschueren/decode-uri-component/blob/00662938dc7c6241547ae8abce7785cc13ffd3f6/index.js\n- https://github.com/SamVerschueren/decode-uri-component/releases/tag/v0.5.0\n- https://www.npmjs.com/package/decode-uri-component\n- https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-vcc3-ghjq-m6fr","created":"2026-08-31T22:10:20.000Z","id":1147955,"npm_advisory_id":null,"overview":"### Impact\nAn attacker who can supply input to `decodeUriComponent()` (directly or via a dependency that uses this package on URL/query/path data) can cause excessive CPU usage and application unresponsiveness. This is an availability issue; there is no known memory corruption, data disclosure, or remote code execution impact.\n\n### Patches\nUpgrade to `decode-uri-component@0.5.0`.\n\n### Workarounds\nLimit the size of the input.","reported_by":null,"title":"decode-uri-component: Denial of service via exponential decoding of malformed percent-encoded input","metadata":null,"cves":["CVE-2026-45822"],"access":"public","severity":"moderate","module_name":"decode-uri-component","vulnerable_versions":"<=0.4.2","github_advisory_id":"GHSA-vcc3-ghjq-m6fr","recommendation":"Upgrade to version 0.5.0 or later","patched_versions":">=0.5.0","updated":"2026-08-31T22:10:21.000Z","cvss":{"score":0,"vectorString":null},"cwe":["CWE-400","CWE-405","CWE